<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ boosts target price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ boosts target price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette analyst Mark Manson said he raised his 12-month price objective on HFS Inc to $100 per share from $90 following news the company would acquire PHH Corp.</p>
<p>-- Kept buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 74-3/8 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
